stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    state "Queued" as queued
    state "Processing" as processing
    state "Retrying" as retrying
    state "Dead letter" as deadLetter
    state "Succeeded" as succeeded
    state failureChoice <<choice>>

    [*] --> queued : enqueue / record initial transition
    queued --> processing : claim [availableAt <= now] / set lease, attempts++
    retrying --> processing : claim [availableAt <= now] / renew lease, attempts++
    processing --> succeeded : commitSucceeded / persist result and outbox
    processing --> failureChoice : processingFailed / classify failure
    failureChoice --> retrying : [retryable and retry budget remains] / schedule delay
    failureChoice --> deadLetter : [permanent or retry budget exhausted] / retain error
    processing --> retrying : leaseExpired / recover immediately
    deadLetter --> queued : redrive [authorized and eligible] / reset attempts
    succeeded --> [*]

    note right of deadLetter
        Redrive is refused for succeeded jobs,
        immutable-payload conflicts, partial results,
        or ineligible permanent failures.
    end note
